@startuml
!include kartoza.iuml
title Study area creation — StudyAreaProcessingTask
start
:Save study area bounding box;
:Enable WAL mode on GeoPackage;
:Create status tracking table;
:Download & process GHSL settlements;
if (GHSL download failed?) then (yes)
  if (User continues without?) then (no)
    :Abort task;
    stop
  endif
endif
:Pre-create all study area layers
(avoids schema races);
while (More boundary features?) is (yes)
  :Normalise area name;
  :Fix invalid geometry (MakeValid);
  :Chunk bbox into processing tiles;
  :Generate grid cells per chunk
  (square grid or H3 hexagons)
  via UnifiedWriterThread;
  :Write clip polygon + raster mask;
endwhile (no)
:Add model columns to study_area_grid;
:Build combined mask VRT;
:Verify GeoPackage health
(gpkg_doctor self-heal);
:Generate study area report (PDF);
stop
@enduml
